# CO-ARCH-002 — Legacy Loan File Retirement

Status: **ENTERPRISE APPROVED** · Loan File is **not** a business entity

## Canonical model

```
Contact / Company → Opportunity → Deal
```

No intermediate Loan File business entity.

## Rules

1. Do **not** introduce user-facing “Loan File” / “Loan Files” product language.
2. Do **not** create a Prisma `LoanFile` model or restore a Loan Files registry book.
3. `/loan-files` remains a **redirect shell** only (deep-link compatibility).
4. TypeScript `LoanFile` is a **deprecated read-only projection** of Opportunity (FS-01) or Deal — not SSOT.
5. `legacyLoanFileId` on Opportunity/Deal is a **retired bridge key** — do not treat as entity identity.
6. New work must use Opportunity Registry and Enterprise Deal Registry types/APIs.

## Quarantine (rename later — do not expand)

- `src/lib/lead-opportunity-journey/opportunity-runtime-adapter.ts`
- `src/lib/enterprise-deal/map-deal-to-loan-file.ts`
- `src/lib/loan-files-storage.ts` (local projection cache only when gated)

